  ('2b51840a-8bec-5497-bdfb-bbcd8294dec0', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g4-figurative-language'), null, 'hard',
   $q$The passage ends, "Slow and careful thinking was his new secret weapon." What does the metaphor "secret weapon" mean here?$q$, $q$[{"text":"a prize that he plans to keep hidden from his friends","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"a special skill that helps him do better than others","is_correct":true},{"text":"a habit that makes him lose games more often than before","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opposite-meaning"},{"text":"a hidden tool he could use to trick the other players","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$a special skill that helps him do better than others$q$, $q$After Diego slowed down, he won three games, so careful thinking became the skill that helped him win. It is not a real object and he is not tricking anyone.$q$, 'draft', '1f73fa7e-1c17-520a-bdd3-2901fea54021')
